<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Privacy Policy – VPOS | Value Tech Solutions</title>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background: #f5f7fa; color: #1a1a2e; line-height: 1.75; }
    header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 60%, #0f3460 100%); color: #fff; padding: 52px 24px 44px; text-align: center; }
    .brand-mark { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 16px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.28); border-radius: 6px; padding: 5px 18px; font-size: 0.74rem; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); }
    header h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.5px; color: #fff; }
    header p { margin-top: 10px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 400; }
    .badge { display: inline-block; margin-top: 16px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.18); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.35); border-radius: 999px; padding: 5px 18px; font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #fff; font-weight: 500; }
    main { max-width: 820px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 0 20px 60px; }
    .card { background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 36px 40px; margin-bottom: 20px; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }
    h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0f3460; margin-bottom: 14px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 2px solid #e8edf5; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
    h2 .icon { font-size: 1.25rem; }
    h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; color: #16213e; margin: 18px 0 10px 0; }
    p { margin-bottom: 12px; color: #444; font-size: 0.95rem; }
    ul { padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #444; font-size: 0.95rem; }
    ul li { margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .highlight-box { background: #f0f4ff; border-left: 4px solid #0f3460; border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px; font-size: 0.93rem; color: #1a1a2e; }
    .info-box { background: #f0fdf4; border-left: 4px solid #10b981; border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px; font-size: 0.93rem; color: #1a1a2e; }
    .warning-box { background: #fff8f0; border-left: 4px solid #e67e22; border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px; font-size: 0.93rem; color: #1a1a2e; }
    .contact-box { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f3460, #16213e); color: #fff; border-radius: 10px; padding: 24px 28px; margin-top: 10px; }
    .contact-box p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.92); margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 0.93rem; }
    .contact-box a { color: #90caf9; text-decoration: none; }
    .contact-box a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    .permission-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; margin: 12px 0; }
    .permission-item { background: #f8faff; border: 1px solid #dde5f5; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 16px; }
    .permission-item strong { display: block; font-size: 0.88rem; color: #0f3460; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .permission-item span { font-size: 0.83rem; color: #666; }
    .retention-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 16px 0; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .retention-table th { background: #f0f4ff; color: #0f3460; padding: 12px; text-align: left; font-weight: 600; border: 1px solid #e0e7f5; }
    .retention-table td { padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e7f5; }
    .retention-table tr:nth-child(even) { background: #f9fafb; }
    footer { text-align: center; padding: 24px 20px; font-size: 0.82rem; color: #555; border-top: 1px solid #e4e8f0; background: #fff; }
    footer strong { color: #1a1a2e; }
    a.back { display: inline-block; margin: 24px 0 0 0; color: #0f3460; font-size: 0.9rem; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; }
    a.back:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    @media (max-width: 560px) { .card { padding: 24px 20px; } .permission-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .retention-table { font-size: 0.85rem; } .retention-table th, .retention-table td { padding: 8px; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="brand-mark">Value Tech Solutions</div>
  <h1>&#x1F512; Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p>VPOS &mdash; A Product of Value Tech Solutions</p>
  <span class="badge">Effective Date: June 1, 2026</span>
</header>

<main>
  <a class="back" href="../index.html">&larr; Back to VPOS Docs</a>

  <div class="card" style="margin-top:20px;">
    <h2><span class="icon">📋</span> Overview</h2>
    <div class="highlight-box">
      VPOS is a cloud-based point-of-sale management system for supermarkets and retail stores in India. You can try VPOS with a trial account or get onboarded by our team for full access. Billing devices are provided by Value Tech Solutions and assigned to your branches based on your subscription plan.
    </div>
    <p>This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and how we protect it. By using VPOS, you agree to this policy.</p>
    <p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> June 1, 2026</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2><span class="icon">🏢</span> About Us</h2>
    <p><strong>Value Tech Solutions</strong> develops and operates the VPOS platform.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Address:</strong> 4th Floor, RJ Complex, SH 35, Varthur – Sarjapur Rd, Yamare Village, Sompura, Bengaluru, Karnataka 562125</li>
      <li><strong>Phone:</strong> 090190 69884</li>
      <li><strong>Email:</strong> support@vposindia.com</li>
      <li><strong>Website:</strong> vposindia.com</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2><span class="icon">🗂️</span> What Information We Collect</h2>

    <h3>During Account Registration</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Mobile phone number (verified with OTP)</li>
      <li>Full name and email address</li>
      <li>Business name and address</li>
      <li>GST number (optional)</li>
      <li>Alternative contact number (optional)</li>
      <li>Profile photo (optional)</li>
      <li>Account type (trial or full subscription)</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>When You Set Up Your Business</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Branch Information:</strong> Branch name, address, contact details, GST settings</li>
      <li><strong>Manager Accounts:</strong> Names and contact information of managers you assign to your branches (full subscription only)</li>
      <li><strong>Staff Information:</strong> Employee names, IDs, and login credentials for billing devices</li>
      <li><strong>Product Information:</strong> Product names, prices, categories, images (based on subscription features)</li>
      <li><strong>Subscription Details:</strong> Plan type, features enabled, billing device allocation, feature limits</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Billing Device Information</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Device serial numbers and identifiers</li>
      <li>Device assignment to branches</li>
      <li>Device model and operating system information</li>
      <li>Sync status (cloud-connected or standalone mode)</li>
      <li>Device registration and activation history</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>During Your Business Operations</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Sales transactions and billing records from your billing devices</li>
      <li>Inventory changes and stock movements</li>
      <li>Reports and analytics you generate</li>
      <li>Device usage logs and sync history</li>
      <li>App usage logs for troubleshooting</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Customer Information (Optional)</h3>
    <div class="highlight-box">
      <strong>Important:</strong> Collecting customer information during billing is entirely optional and requires customer consent. You are responsible for obtaining permission before collecting any customer data. Value Tech Solutions is not liable for unauthorized data collection.
    </div>

    <h3>System Information</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Login history and access times</li>
      <li>Account changes and modifications</li>
      <li>Subscription changes and billing history</li>
      <li>Feature usage and limit tracking</li>
      <li>Error logs for technical support</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2><span class="icon">📷</span> App Permissions</h2>
    <p>VPOS applications may request the following permissions:</p>
    <div class="permission-grid">
      <div class="permission-item">
        <strong>📷 Camera</strong>
        <span>To scan QR codes for device registration and capture product photos (if enabled in your subscription).</span>
      </div>
      <div class="permission-item">
        <strong>🖼️ Storage</strong>
        <span>To save product images and export reports to your device.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="permission-item">
        <strong>🔔 Notifications</strong>
        <span>To send alerts about sales, subscription status, device events, and important messages.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="permission-item">
        <strong>🌐 Internet</strong>
        <span>To sync data with cloud services. Cloud-connected devices sync transactions automatically; standalone devices operate without internet.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="permission-item">
        <strong>📡 Local Network</strong>
        <span>For standalone mode devices to communicate with each other on your local network.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p>You can deny permissions, but some features may not work. Billing devices can operate offline and sync when internet is available.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2><span class="icon">⚙️</span> How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To provide and operate the VPOS platform</li>
      <li>To manage your account, subscription plan, and feature access</li>
      <li>To provision and assign billing devices to your branches</li>
      <li>To manage branches, managers, and staff accounts</li>
      <li>To process billing transactions and generate reports</li>
      <li>To track subscription usage and enforce feature limits</li>
      <li>To send important notifications, subscription reminders, and system alerts</li>
      <li>To provide technical support and troubleshoot issues</li>
      <li>To improve our services and user experience</li>
      <li>To comply with Indian tax and business regulations</li>
      <li>To prevent fraud and ensure platform security</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>We never sell or share your data for marketing purposes.</strong></p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2><span class="icon">☁️</span> Data Storage &amp; Security</h2>
    
    <h3>Where Your Data is Stored</h3>
    <p>All cloud-connected data is stored on secure servers located in India (Mumbai region) to comply with Indian data localization laws. Standalone mode devices store data locally on the device and your local network only.</p>

    <h3>Security Measures</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Encryption:</strong> All data is encrypted during transmission and storage</li>
      <li><strong>Access Control:</strong> You and your authorized managers can access your business data based on assigned permissions</li>
      <li><strong>Data Isolation:</strong> Your business data is completely separated from other users</li>
      <li><strong>Device Security:</strong> Billing devices use secure authentication for device-to-cloud communication</li>
      <li><strong>Regular Monitoring:</strong> System logs track all access and changes</li>
      <li><strong>Security Audits:</strong> Regular checks for vulnerabilities</li>
      <li><strong>Two-Factor Authentication:</strong> Available for enhanced account security</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Who Can Access Your Data</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>You:</strong> Full access to your business data</li>
      <li><strong>Your Managers:</strong> Access only to branches you assign them (full subscription only)</li>
      <li><strong>Your Staff:</strong> Limited access to billing functions on assigned devices</li>
      <li><strong>Support Team:</strong> Limited access for technical support when you request help</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Standalone Mode Data</h3>
    <div class="info-box">
      Standalone mode devices do NOT sync data to the cloud. All data remains on your local devices and network. You are solely responsible for data backup and security in standalone mode.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2><span class="icon">🗑️</span> How Long We Keep Your Data</h2>
    <table class="retention-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Data Type</th>
          <th>How Long</th>
          <th>Why</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>Active Account Information</td>
          <td>As long as your account is active</td>
          <td>To provide services</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Inactive/Deactivated Accounts</td>
          <td>90 days after deactivation</td>
          <td>Allow time to reactivate</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Scheduled Deletions</td>
          <td>15 days grace period</td>
          <td>Allow cancellation of deletion</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Sales &amp; Billing Records</td>
          <td>Minimum 6 years from end of financial year</td>
          <td>Indian tax law compliance (GST Act 2017 Section 36, Income Tax Act 1961 Section 44AA)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Product Images</td>
          <td>Based on your subscription retention settings (0-90 days after disabling)</td>
          <td>Configurable per plan</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>System Logs &amp; Audit Trails</td>
          <td>90 days</td>
          <td>Troubleshooting and security</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Subscription &amp; Billing History</td>
          <td>Minimum 6 years from end of financial year</td>
          <td>GST Act 2017 Section 36 &amp; Income Tax Act 1961 Section 44AA compliance</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="info-box">
      <strong>Custom Retention Periods:</strong> Depending on your subscription plan, you may have custom retention periods for certain data types. Contact our support team at <strong>support@vposindia.com</strong> or call <strong>090190 69884</strong> for details.
    </div>

    <h3>Account Deletion & Data Handling</h3>
    <p>When your account is scheduled for deletion, you have a <strong>15-day grace period</strong> to cancel. After this period, we process your data as follows:</p>

    <div class="highlight-box">
      <strong>Privacy-First Deletion Process:</strong>
      <ul style="margin-top:8px;">
        <li><strong>Customer Contact Information:</strong> All customer names, phone numbers, and email addresses stored in your account are <strong>permanently deleted immediately</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Transaction Records:</strong> Bills and invoices are <strong>anonymized</strong> (customer names replaced with "[REDACTED]", phone numbers removed) and retained for minimum 6 years per Indian tax law</li>
        <li><strong>Transaction Anonymization Ensures:</strong> Tax compliance while protecting customer privacy — anonymized records cannot be used to identify individual customers</li>
        <li><strong>Business Data:</strong> Product inventory, pricing, images, and business configuration are <strong>permanently deleted</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Manager & Staff Accounts:</strong> All associated accounts are <strong>permanently deleted</strong> from the system</li>
        <li><strong>Authentication Records:</strong> All login credentials and authentication tokens are <strong>permanently deleted</strong></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <p><strong>Legal Compliance:</strong> Anonymized transaction records are retained for tax audit purposes as required by:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>GST Act 2017, Section 36:</strong> 6-year minimum retention for GST-related records</li>
      <li><strong>Income Tax Act 1961, Section 44AA:</strong> 6-year minimum retention for business accounts</li>
      <li><strong>Financial Year Calculation:</strong> Retention period is calculated from the end of the financial year (April 1 - March 31), not from transaction date</li>
    </ul>

    <p><strong>Important:</strong> Anonymized records contain only transaction amounts, dates, product details, and GST information — <strong>no personally identifiable customer information is retained</strong>.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2><span class="icon">🔐</span> Your Rights</h2>
    <p>You have the right to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Access Your Data:</strong> Request a copy of your business information and transaction records</li>
      <li><strong>Update Your Information:</strong> Edit your business profile, inventory, staff details, and branch information directly in the VPOS app</li>
      <li><strong>Request Account Deletion:</strong> Contact our support team to request permanent account deletion (subject to 15-day review period and legal retention requirements)</li>
      <li><strong>Export Your Data:</strong> Request a downloadable copy of your business data for your records</li>
      <li><strong>Cancel Your Subscription:</strong> Contact support to cancel your subscription or request account closure</li>
    </ul>
    
    <p><strong>How to Exercise Your Rights:</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Update Information:</strong> You can edit your business details, inventory, and staff information directly in the VPOS app anytime</li>
      <li><strong>Data Requests:</strong> To access, export, or delete your data, contact our support team at <strong>support@vposindia.com</strong> or call <strong>090190 69884</strong></li>
      <li><strong>Subscription Changes:</strong> For subscription upgrades, downgrades, or cancellations, contact our support team</li>
      <li><strong>Response Time:</strong> We process all data requests within 30 days as required by Indian law</li>
    </ul>
    
    <div class="info-box">
      <strong>Important:</strong> After account deletion, anonymized transaction records are retained for 6 years to comply with GST Act 2017 Section 36 and Income Tax Act 1961 Section 44AA. All customer names, phone numbers, and personally identifiable information are permanently removed immediately. Only transaction amounts, dates, and product details are retained for tax compliance.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2><span class="icon">🌐</span> Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>VPOS uses trusted third-party services:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Cloud Services:</strong> For secure data storage and backup (cloud-connected mode only)</li>
      <li><strong>SMS Services:</strong> For OTP delivery during login</li>
      <li><strong>Email Services:</strong> For subscription notifications and support (if enabled in your plan)</li>
      <li><strong>Payment Services:</strong> For secure subscription payment processing</li>
    </ul>
    <p>All partners comply with Indian data protection laws and maintain high security standards.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2><span class="icon">🇮🇳</span> Compliance with Indian Laws</h2>
    <p>VPOS follows all applicable Indian laws:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Information Technology Act, 2000</strong> &mdash; Data protection and security</li>
      <li><strong>IT Security Rules, 2011</strong> &mdash; Security practices and procedures</li>
      <li><strong>Consumer Protection Act, 2019</strong> &mdash; Consumer rights and data handling</li>
      <li><strong>GST Act 2017, Section 36</strong> &mdash; 6-year retention for financial records</li>
      <li><strong>Income Tax Act 1961, Section 44AA</strong> &mdash; 6-year minimum retention for business records</li>
      <li><strong>Data Localization</strong> &mdash; All cloud data stored within India</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2><span class="icon">📧</span> Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy occasionally. When we do, we will:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Update the "Effective Date" at the top</li>
      <li>Notify you through the app</li>
      <li>Send an email to your registered address (if email service is enabled)</li>
      <li>Show a notification on the login screen</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Continued use of VPOS means you accept any changes made to this policy.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2><span class="icon">☎️</span> Contact Us</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy or your data? Contact us:</p>
    <div class="contact-box">
      <p><strong>Value Tech Solutions</strong></p>
      <p>4th Floor, RJ Complex, SH 35, Varthur – Sarjapur Rd</p>
      <p>Yamare Village, Sompura, Bengaluru, Karnataka 562125</p>
      <p>📞 <strong>Phone:</strong> 090190 69884</p>
      <p>📧 <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@vposindia.com">support@vposindia.com</a></p>
      <p>🌐 <strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://vposindia.com" target="_blank">vposindia.com</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>

</main>

